<main id="main">
<section class="hero container" id="home">
<div class="hero-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow"><span class="green-dot"></span> INTELLIGENCE FOR EVERY ACRE</div><h1>Know your field.<br>Protect its <span>future.</span></h1></div><div class="hero-intro"><p>A fresh perspective on agriculture. Connecting fixed cameras, mobile phones, drones and ground robotics through agricultural artificial intelligence.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="#platforms">Explore AgroSentinel <svg><use href="#up-right"/></svg></a><a class="quiet-link" href="#about">Discover our vision <svg><use href="#arrow"/></svg></a></div></div></div>
<div class="hero-photograph"><img asp-append-version="true" src="/images/field-photo.jpg" alt="Parallel rows of green crops across an open field" width="1800" height="1012" fetchpriority="high"><div class="photo-topline"><span>ONE CONNECTED FIELD</span><span>AGROSENTINEL / AGRICULTURAL MONITORING</span></div><div class="photo-bottomline"><p>Every perspective.<br>One healthier future.</p><a href="#films" class="photo-play" aria-label="Watch the AgroSentinel films"><span><svg><use href="#play"/></svg></span><strong>Watch the story</strong></a></div></div>
<div class="hero-footer"><span>A PROJECT BY THE HASHEMITE UNIVERSITY</span><p>Cameras <span>+</span> Computer vision <span>+</span> Connected agriculture</p></div>
</section>
<section class="section container about" id="about">
<div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">A BETTER PERSPECTIVE</span><h2>Closer to the field.<br>Closer to what <span>matters.</span></h2></div><p>Healthy crops start with understanding what is happening around them. AgroSentinel explores how intelligent monitoring can turn images and sensor observations into useful agricultural insight.</p></div>
<div class="benefits"><article><h3>Understand crop conditions.</h3><p>Bring attention to visible plant conditions through image analysis and evidence that can be reviewed.</p></article><article><h3>Recognize visible hazards.</h3><p>Identify fire and smoke in camera frames, with confirmation before creating an alert.</p></article><article><h3>Connect the bigger picture.</h3><p>Bring cameras, ground observations and the mobile application into a shared monitoring approach.</p></article></div>
</section>
<section class="section platforms-wrap" id="platforms"><div class="container">
<div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">MANY PERSPECTIVES. ONE CONNECTED FIELD.</span><h2>Wherever you look.<br><span>A clearer picture.</span></h2></div><p>A fixed view of the field. A photo from your phone. A camera carried through the crops or flown above them. AgroSentinel is designed to bring these perspectives into one monitoring approach.</p></div>
<div class="camera-grid" aria-label="Everyday camera sources">
<article class="platform camera-card"><div class="platform-photo"><img asp-append-version="true" src="/images/fixed-camera-photo.jpg" alt="A pole-mounted monitoring camera overlooking rows of crops in a field" width="1100" height="733" loading="lazy"><span class="image-label">A FIXED PERSPECTIVE</span><span class="source-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg><use href="#camera"/></svg></span></div><div class="platform-heading"><h3>Fixed cameras.</h3><span class="platform-number">01</span></div><p>Keep a familiar area in view. Accessible IP and CCTV camera feeds can provide frames for crop observation and visible fire-and-smoke analysis.</p><ul class="tags"><li>IP & CCTV feeds</li><li>Field observation</li></ul></article>
<article class="platform camera-card"><div class="platform-photo"><img asp-append-version="true" src="/images/phone-camera-photo.jpg" alt="A farmer photographing a tomato plant with a mobile phone in the field" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy"><span class="image-label">IN YOUR HANDS</span><span class="source-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg><use href="#phone"/></svg></span></div><div class="platform-heading"><h3>Mobile phones.</h3><span class="platform-number">02</span></div><p>Take a closer look, wherever you are. Capture a plant photo for analysis, then review detection images and event details in the mobile application.</p><ul class="tags"><li>Plant photographs</li><li>Mobile review</li></ul></article>
<article class="platform camera-card"><div class="platform-photo"><img asp-append-version="true" src="/images/usb-camera-photo.webp" alt="A USB webcam mounted on the top edge of a computer display" width="1920" height="1280" loading="lazy"><span class="image-label">CLOSE AND CONNECTED</span><span class="source-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg><use href="#camera"/></svg></span></div><div class="platform-heading"><h3>USB & other cameras.</h3><span class="platform-number">03</span></div><p>Bring the camera to the crop. USB webcams and other accessible video sources offer flexible inputs for close-range observation and image analysis.</p><ul class="tags"><li>USB webcams</li><li>Video sources</li></ul></article>
</div>
<div class="platform-divider"><span>CAMERAS ON THE MOVE</span><p>The same vision, carried across the field.</p></div>
<div class="platform-grid">
<article class="platform"><div class="platform-photo"><img src="/images/drone-photo.jpg" alt="A multirotor agricultural drone flying over a cultivated field" width="1600" height="900" loading="lazy"><span class="image-label">AERIAL PERSPECTIVE</span><button class="round-play" data-play="drone" aria-label="Watch the drone film"><svg><use href="#play"/></svg></button></div><div class="platform-heading"><h3>The drone.</h3><span class="platform-number">04</span></div><p>A view from above brings crop areas and visible hazards into focus. Accessible camera feeds become a source for agricultural image analysis.</p><ul class="tags"><li>Aerial imagery</li><li>Crop observation</li><li>Fire & smoke monitoring</li></ul></article>
<article class="platform"><div class="platform-photo"><img src="/images/rover-photo.jpg" alt="A Phoenix agricultural research robot moving between crop rows" width="1140" height="695" loading="lazy"><span class="image-label">GROUND PERSPECTIVE</span><button class="round-play" data-play="rover" aria-label="Watch the rover film"><svg><use href="#play"/></svg></button></div><details class="photo-credit"><summary>Image credit</summary><p>Photography: DLG e.V. / Prof. Dr. sc. agr. Hans W. Griepentrog. <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:AgriRobot.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original photograph</a> · <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>. Displayed with responsive cropping.</p></details><div class="platform-heading"><h3>The ground rover.</h3><span class="platform-number">05</span></div><p>A ground platform brings observation closer to the crop. Its role extends to integrating soil and environmental sensors alongside visual information.</p><ul class="tags"><li>Close-range observation</li><li>Soil-sensor integration</li><li>Ground robotics</li></ul></article>
</div>
</div></section>
<section class="section container technology" id="technology">
<div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">PURPOSEFUL INTELLIGENCE</span><h2>See the detail.<br><span>Understand the signal.</span></h2></div><p>Different perspectives call for different models. Our approach separates close-up plant analysis, distant imagery, and fire-and-smoke detection.</p></div>
<div class="intelligence-layout"><figure class="intelligence-photo"><img id="intelligence-image" src="/images/leaf-photo.jpg" alt="A young tomato plant photographed close up, with water droplets on its leaves" width="1200" height="900" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span id="intelligence-caption">A CLOSER LOOK AT THE CROP</span><svg><use href="#up-right"/></svg></figcaption></figure>
<div class="model-accordion">
<article class="model-item is-open"><h3><button id="model-closeup" class="model-trigger" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="panel-closeup" data-model="closeup"><span class="model-index">01</span><span>Close-up plant analysis</span><span class="plus" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></h3><div id="panel-closeup" class="model-content" role="region" aria-labelledby="model-closeup"><p>A closer image reveals the detail. Plant photographs from a mobile phone, USB camera or ground rover provide the visual input for close-up crop analysis.</p><div class="model-detail"><svg><use href="#camera"/></svg><span>Close-up imagery</span></div><div class="model-detail"><svg><use href="#leaf"/></svg><span>Plant-condition identification</span></div></div></article>
<article class="model-item"><h3><button id="model-far" class="model-trigger" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="panel-far" data-model="far"><span class="model-index">02</span><span>Distant & aerial analysis</span><span class="plus" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></h3><div id="panel-far" class="model-content" role="region" aria-labelledby="model-far" hidden><p>A wider image brings more of the field into view. Distant images from fixed cameras and accessible aerial feeds offer another perspective on crop areas.</p><div class="model-detail"><svg><use href="#camera"/></svg><span>Distant and aerial imagery</span></div><div class="model-detail"><svg><use href="#leaf"/></svg><span>Crop-area observations</span></div></div></article>
<article class="model-item"><h3><button id="model-fire" class="model-trigger" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="panel-fire" data-model="fire"><span class="model-index">03</span><span>Fire & smoke detection</span><span class="plus" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></h3><div id="panel-fire" class="model-content" role="region" aria-labelledby="model-fire" hidden><p>Scene analysis identifies visible fire and smoke. Sustained detections can be confirmed and saved with their image evidence for review.</p><div class="model-detail"><svg><use href="#fire"/></svg><span>Fire and smoke localization</span></div><div class="model-detail"><svg><use href="#check"/></svg><span>Confirmed, image-backed events</span></div></div></article>
<p class="technology-outro">The right input. The right model.<br>A more useful result.</p>
</div></div>
</section>
<section class="system-section" id="system"><div class="container">
<div class="system-shell"><div class="system-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE CONNECTED SYSTEM</span><h2>From observation.<br>To <span>understanding.</span></h2></div><p>Camera input, AI analysis and the mobile application come together in a clear path from capture to review.</p></div>
<div class="flow-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Explore the monitoring pipeline">
<button id="flow-capture" class="flow-step active" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="flow-panel" data-step="capture"><span class="flow-node"><svg><use href="#camera"/></svg></span><small>01 / CAPTURE</small><strong>See the field.</strong></button>
<button id="flow-analyze" class="flow-step" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="flow-panel" data-step="analyze" tabindex="-1"><span class="flow-node"><svg><use href="#chip"/></svg></span><small>02 / ANALYZE</small><strong>Find the signal.</strong></button>
<button id="flow-confirm" class="flow-step" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="flow-panel" data-step="confirm" tabindex="-1"><span class="flow-node"><svg><use href="#check"/></svg></span><small>03 / CONFIRM</small><strong>Keep the evidence.</strong></button>
<button id="flow-review" class="flow-step" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="flow-panel" data-step="review" tabindex="-1"><span class="flow-node"><svg><use href="#phone"/></svg></span><small>04 / REVIEW</small><strong>Reach the phone.</strong></button>
</div>
<div id="flow-panel" class="flow-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="flow-capture" tabindex="0"><h3 id="flow-title">Different sources. One starting point.</h3><p id="flow-description">Capture a plant photo on a mobile phone, connect an accessible fixed or USB camera feed, or use imagery from a drone or rover. Photos, video frames and recordings enter the shared analysis pipeline.</p><div id="flow-tags" class="flow-tags"><span>Fixed / IP cameras</span><span>Mobile phones</span><span>USB cameras</span><span>Drone & rover feeds</span><span>Recorded video</span></div></div>
</div>
<div class="software-strip"><span>BUILT TO CONNECT</span><div><span>Flutter</span><span>Python & AI</span><span>ASP.NET Core</span><span>Firebase</span><span>Camera adapters</span></div></div>
</div></section>
<section class="section container films" id="films">
<div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">MEET AGROSENTINEL</span><h2>A vision worth<br><span>seeing in motion.</span></h2></div><p>Explore the drone and ground-rover perspectives through our project films.</p></div>
<div class="film-toolbar"><div class="film-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Choose a project film"><button id="film-tab-drone" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="film-panel" data-film="drone"><svg><use href="#play"/></svg>The drone<span>00:48</span></button><button id="film-tab-rover" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="film-panel" data-film="rover" tabindex="-1"><svg><use href="#play"/></svg>The ground rover<span>01:14</span></button></div><span class="film-toolbar-label">TWO PERSPECTIVES. ONE CONNECTED FIELD.</span></div>
